    "author": {
      "canonical": "無名氏",
      "recorded": "無名氏",
      "gender": "male",
      "english_name": "anonymous",
      "wikidata_id": "Q4233718"
    },
    "title": "王昭君",
    "poem": [
      "猗蘭恩寵歇，昭陽幸御稀。",
      "朝辭漢闕去，夕見胡塵飛。",
      "寄信秦樓下，因書秋雁歸。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_786_006_01",
    "volume": 786,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "無名氏",
      "recorded": "無名氏",
      "gender": "male",
      "english_name": "anonymous",
      "wikidata_id": "Q4233718"
    },
    "title": "又",
    "poem": [
      "一回望月一回悲，望月月移人不移。",
      "何時得見漢朝使，為妾傳書斬畫師。"
    ],
    "notes": [
      {
        "content": "一作崔國輔詩。",
        "context": "又",
        "original_title": "又",
        "type": "footnote"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_786_007_01",
