    "volume": 786,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "無名氏",
      "recorded": "無名氏",
      "gender": "male",
      "english_name": "anonymous",
      "wikidata_id": "Q4233718"
    },
    "title": "宮詞",
    "poem": [
      "花萼樓前春正濃，濛濛柳絮舞晴空。",
      "金錢擲罷嬌無力，笑倚欄干屈曲中。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_786_014_01",
    "volume": 786,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "無名氏",
      "recorded": "無名氏",
      "gender": "male",
      "english_name": "anonymous",
      "wikidata_id": "Q4233718"
    },
    "title": "拋球詩",
    "poem": [
      "侍宴黃昏未肯休，玉階夜色月如流。",
      "朝來自詫承恩最，笑倩傍人認繡毬。"
    ],
    "notes": [
      {
        "content": "一作李謹詩。",
        "context": "拋球詩",
        "original_title": "拋球詩",
        "type": "footnote"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
